BY ACCESSING, DOWNLOADING, OR USING THE SOFTWARE, YOU AGREE TO BE BOUND BY
THIS AGREEMENT. IF YOU DO NOT ACCEPT THESE TERMS, DO NOT USE THE SOFTWARE.

The Software is a passive, read-only, local analysis tool for third-party
anticheat software, including - without limitation - Javelin (Electronic
Arts Inc.), BattlEye (BattlEye Innovations e.K.), Easy Anti-Cheat (Epic
Games Inc.), and HoYoProtect (HoYoverse / miHoYo Co., Ltd.). It allows the
User to inspect data such software collects on their own machine, for
purposes including:

  a) Exercising data access rights under the GDPR (Regulation (EU) 2016/679);
  b) Assessing security and stability risks on the User's own system;
  c) Personal or educational cybersecurity research;
  d) Reviewing the compliance of third-party software with applicable
     privacy laws.

The Software must be used exclusively on machines owned or legally
controlled by the User. Use against any third-party system without explicit
authorization is strictly prohibited.

The Software contains no functionality to modify game behavior, inject code
into third-party processes, or bypass protection mechanisms. It is not
designed or distributed to facilitate cheating.


